WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.260
Strange music drifts across an island.

2
00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:07.180
A shipwrecked prince
follows it, step by step.

3
00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:11.230
It leads him to a girl who
has only ever seen two men.

4
00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:12.720
They look at each other.

5
00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:18.360
Her father watches, and murmurs: "At
the first sight they have changed eyes."

6
00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:23.130
Then he steps between them, and points
the young man at a pile of logs.

7
00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:28.520
So is this love at first sight,
or a match Prospero is arranging?

8
00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:31.580
In this mission, you'll
listen to Prospero's asides,

9
00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:34.080
the lines only the audience can hear.

10
00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:40.170
You'll hear Miranda speak out in Act 3,
and see why Prospero sets such hard tests.

11
00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:45.650
Your mission: decide whether this is love
at first sight or a match Prospero arranged.
